msgid ""
"For the convenience of development, older PySME versions used runtime "
"SMElib download on first import. From `v0.7.0`, PySME uses strict one-to-"
"one version matching with SMElib at release time. Each PySME release is "
"pinned to one specific SMElib release, and the mapping is recorded "
"explicitly in the table below. This avoids accidental runtime mismatch "
"with a newer upstream SMElib release."
